# 1. DOCUMENT PURPOSE

This document is the final implementation contract for ZyrionOS.

Its purpose is to ensure that every feature, page, component,
frontend interaction, backend integration, authentication flow,
AI workflow, deployment workflow, billing workflow, and production
release follows the architecture and product decisions established
through Documents 01–09.

This document does NOT redefine the previous documents.

Instead, it establishes:

- final implementation authority
- implementation order
- acceptance criteria
- quality gates
- integration requirements
- production-readiness requirements
- release requirements
- change-control rules
- regression rules
- final verification standards

No feature should be considered complete merely because:

- the UI looks correct
- the frontend compiles
- an API responds
- a page opens
- a button works once

A feature is complete only when it satisfies the complete
ZyrionOS implementation contract.

