# 3. SOURCE OF TRUTH

The ten documents collectively form the ZyrionOS product
and engineering source of truth.

When implementation questions arise:

1. Check the relevant document.
2. Follow its defined contract.
3. Do not invent an alternative implementation.
4. Do not introduce a local design decision that conflicts
   with the global architecture.
