ZyrionOS must work across:

- desktop
- laptop
- tablet
- mobile

Responsive behavior must be designed intentionally.

Do not simply shrink the desktop interface.

Complex areas such as:

- Workspace
- AI Chat
- Project Explorer
- Inspector
- Settings
- Billing
- Tables

must have dedicated responsive behavior.

